<title>USA: Storage USA files $450 mln shelf.</title>
<headline>Storage USA files $450 mln shelf.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Storage USA Inc filed a shelf registration with the Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $450 million in debt, preferred and common stock and warrants.</p>
<p>When combined with a previous registration, Storage will have a total of up to $600 million in securities available for sale.</p>
</text>
